。\n\n- **证据支撑**：\n  - 聚合日志明确报出 `message: \"CONFIG_MISSING\"` 且发生在处理 `path: \"/work\"` 时（事实 #3）。\n  - 追踪记录（Tracing）证实该请求最终返回 `HTTP 500`（事实 #4）。\n  - Kubernetes 状态显示容器反复以退出码 `78` 终止并处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（事实 #1, #5）。\n\n- **未决事项**：虽然确认了配置缺失是退出原因，但尚未在证据中明确指出具体缺失的是哪个 ConfigMap 或环境变量键名（即“application_span”中仅记录 `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit`，未展开具体字段名）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 53.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 53.1s (Evidence 43.5s, RCA 9.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 83.623, "metrics": {"run_id": "bc25c5956dc94311", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 83.6241660118103, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_scor